WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.544
(audience applauding)

00:00:01.544 --> 00:00:06.270
- So, the season finale of
"Ted Lasso" is about to happen,

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.980
and I've heard it might be the end end.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.850
Is it the end end?

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.770
- Well, I don't know, I mean
- We don't like

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:11.910
to be finite?
- Jason says it's like

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.450
the end of that three season arc?

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.590
- Oh, interesting.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:17.423
- Yeah.

00:00:17.423 --> 00:00:18.930
I mean I feel like trapping him

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.570
in a dungeon with a notepad and a pen.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.710
- It's a good idea.
- And just going,

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.630
dude, what are you doing?

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.460
You can't step away from it.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.720
The characters are so beloved,

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.553
and we all love it.
- Yeah.

00:00:28.553 --> 00:00:31.487
- I mean, I would play her
when her teeth are falling out

00:00:31.487 --> 00:00:33.490
in a retirement home
- Such a great character.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.000
- sitting outside it with
mud splashing her, you know?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.700
I would, I just want to see her through.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.678
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:40.511
- I love her so much.
- I love the idea of that

00:00:40.511 --> 00:00:42.586
though, of almost taking a show

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:43.419
(audience applauding)

00:00:43.419 --> 00:00:45.060
and doing it in different,

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.500
almost how they do with Marvel.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.333
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.500
You'd see different characters
and different things.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.470
- Yeah, exactly.
- That's a cool idea.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:50.504
You all should do that,
- Bouncing off elsewhere.

00:00:50.504 --> 00:00:51.593
- Jason.
- Yeah.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.400
No, Jason.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.233
Where's the camera?

00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:55.153
Jason.

00:00:55.153 --> 00:00:57.224
- (laughing) I love it you
went American for Jason.

00:00:57.224 --> 00:00:58.361
- Jason.

00:00:58.361 --> 00:00:59.289
(both laughing)

